{
  "A full-featured calendar for appointments across days and hours. It provides day, week, work week and month views, all-day and multi-day bars, side-by-side display of overlapping appointments, and a \"+N more\" link when a day is full. Appointments can come from an array or a data source, and every setting can change at runtime.": "",
  "Getting started": "",
  "Provide the appointments. By default, it reads `startDate`, `endDate`, `text` and `allDay`, and `fields` maps other names. The toolbar moves by the view's step, and the date opens a calendar.": "",
  "Views and settings": "Görünümler ve ayarlar",
  "`views` lists the built-in types or custom views, each with a name, a caption, an `intervalCount` and settings that override the scheduler's. Every setting accepts a value or a function that is tracked.": "",
  "With a `DataSource` (REST, OData or a service), it requests only the visible days and requests again when the view moves. It shows a loading state, and offers a retry if a request fails.": "",
  "`appointmentTemplate` customizes the content of each appointment. The scheduler still positions it, colors it with `color` and provides its accessible name.": "",
  "Moves across the cells, mirrored on right-to-left pages. Moving past the first or last day advances the view. Up from the first time moves to the all-day panel, and in the month view Up and Down move by a week.": "",
  "Extends the selection from the starting cell.": "",
  "Moves to the first or last day of the row. With Ctrl, moves to the first or last cell.": "",
  "Moves up or down one screen of times. In the month view, moves to the previous or next month.": "",
  "On a cell, equivalent to a double-click and a click. The same applies to an appointment.": "",
  "Clears the selection.": "Seçimi temizler.",
  "The toolbar, the cells (one Tab stop), the all-day panel, and then each appointment.": "",
  "Today, next and previous (the `keys` option, not active in a text field).": "",
  "Day, week, work week and month view.": "Gün, hafta, iş haftası ve ay görünümü.",
  "The time grid is a `grid`, as are the all-day panel and the month, with one Tab stop. Each cell is named by its day and time and has `aria-selected`.": "",
  "Buttons in their own group after the cells, named by their time, text and day (\"continues\" when they span days).": "",
  "A new date or view is announced in a polite live region (`announce`).": "",
  "`aria-busy` while the data source loads. A failed load is an alert with Retry.": "",
  "Dates and times come from `Intl` using `locale` (12 or 24-hour clock, first day of the week). Strings come from `uiLocale` (English, Turkish), and `texts` can override each one.": "",
  "The toolbar.": "",
  "The day views: `data-today`, `data-work`, `data-hour-start`, `aria-selected`.": "Gün görünümleri: `data-today`, `data-work`, `data-hour-start`, `aria-selected`.",
  "`data-kind=\"timed|bar|chip\"`, `data-before`, `data-after`, `data-short`, `data-past`, `data-disabled`. Its color is `--_color`.": "",
  "\"+N more\", its list, and the current time indicator.": "",
  "Units: every part in each state (for a cell: `today`, `off`, `holiday`, `month`, `outside`, `weekend`, `past`, `hover`, `selected`, `focus` …).": "",
  "Sizes, and the ratios that blend an appointment's color into its fill, text and four edges.": "",
  "The in-memory appointments. Your data can be plain or reactive, and the component reads it as it is. After changing it in place, call `refresh()`. Changes made by the component (the form, a drag, the methods) appear immediately.": "",
  "Appointments from `@motifx-community/data`, used instead of `appointments`.": "",
  "Requests only the visible days from the data source, by adding a filter on the start and end fields.": "",
  "See below": "",
  "The fields it reads: `key`, `start`, `end`, `text`, `allDay`, `description`, `color`, `disabled` and `visible`.": "",
  "Day, week, work week, month": "",
  "The available views. A `SchedulerView` has its own `name`, `text`, `intervalCount`, hours, `cellDuration`, `allDayPanel` and `maxAppointmentsPerCell`.": "",
  "The week view": "",
  "The current view, by name.": "",
  "Today": "",
  "The date the view shows.": "Görünümün gösterdiği tarih.",
  "From the locale": "",
  "Monday to Friday": "",
  "The work week, and the days shaded separately.": "",
  "The work hours. The rest are shaded.": "",
  "The hours shown in the day columns.": "",
  "The duration of a cell, in minutes.": "",
  "Shows the all-day and multi-day panel above the hours.": "",
  "The number of lines the all-day panel shows before \"+N more\".": "",
  "The number of appointments in a month day before \"+N more\". `auto` shows as many as fit.": "",
  "Shows overlapping appointments side by side, or stacked with a slight offset.": "",
  "Days marked as holidays.": "Tatil olarak işaretlenen günler.",
  "Shows a line at the current time.": "",
  "Dims appointments that have ended.": "",
  "Work start": "",
  "The hour the day columns scroll to. By default, this is the work start, or the current time later in the day.": "",
  "Shows the toolbar with today, previous, next, the date and the views.": "",
  "Dates, times and the week.": "Tarihler, saatler ve hafta.",
  "Customizes an appointment's content: `{ appointment, start, end, text, time, allDay, view }`.": "",
  "Strings that override `uiLocale`.": "",
  "The key bindings. An empty list disables a binding.": "",
  "Announces a new date or view to screen readers.": "",
  "Moves the view, raising `onDateChanging`.": "",
  "Shows a date or another view.": "",
  "Scrolls the day columns to a time of day.": "Gün sütunlarını günün bir saatine kaydırır.",
  "Selects the cells for a time range in the visible days.": "",
  "Returns the appointments in a time range, or one by its key.": "",
  "Re-reads the appointments and resources. Your data can be plain or reactive, and the component reads it as it is. After changing it in place, call `refresh()`.": "",
  "Re-reads one appointment after it has been changed in place. For an occurrence, this means its series.": "",
  "Re-reads the resources after their items have been changed in place.": "",
  "Reactive state.": "Reactive durum.",
  "A string from `uiLocale` or `texts`, with its values filled in.": "",
  "`{ from, to, byUser, cancel }`: a view change. Cancel to keep the current view.": "",
  "`{ from, to, byUser, cancel }` and `{ …, range }`: today, previous, next or a selected date.": "",
  "`{ cell: { start, end, allDay }, event, cancel }`. Also raised by Space and Enter on a cell.": "",
  "`{ appointment, start, end, event, cancel }`. Also raised by Space and Enter on an appointment.": "",
  "`{ selection }`: the selected cells as one time range, or `null`.": "",
  "`{ range, appointments }`: after a load, a new date or view, or new data.": "",
  "`{ date, appointments, cancel }`: \"+N more\" was clicked. Cancel to display the day yourself.": ""
}
